sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant T as Temporal workflow
  participant Mg as Manager (Teams)
  participant P as Policy gateway
  participant R as Rubrik
  participant G as MCP gateway
  participant S as IGA (via MCP)
  participant V as Veza
  T->>Mg: Approval card for AR-1102
  Mg->>T: Signal: approve (audited first)
  T->>P: Activity: provision_access
  Note over P: HIGH risk: approval evidence found, ALLOW
  P->>R: Pre-action record
  P->>G: Call with delegated token (aud = action server)
  G->>S: Grant FinanceERP read
  S-->>T: Granted (idempotent)
  T->>V: Activity: verify effective access
  V-->>T: Access matches the request
  Note over T,Mg: Resume the conversation and notify the employee
